## Third-party components

### livekit / client-sdk-android (the whole tree, re-packaged as `com.gravixcloud.rtc`)
Android client SDK for real-time audio/video rooms.
- Project: https://github.com/livekit/client-sdk-android
- Version: v2.28.2, plus upstream fixes #1010 and #1023 (cherry-picked from v2.29.0)
- Copyright 2021-2026 LiveKit, Inc. (upstream NOTICE, reproduced verbatim below)
- License: Apache-2.0 — https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0
- Notes: re-branded for white-label distribution by `tools/rebrand/rebrand.sh` (packages, module and
  Maven names, public type names, log tags, runtime strings). Each derived source file keeps the
  upstream copyright notice, followed by "Modifications Copyright 2026 Gravity Compile" and the
  unchanged license header. Generic type names (`Room`, `Track`, `Participant`, …) are preserved to
  keep upstream merges clean.

### livekit / protocol (`protocol/`, `.proto` sources)
Protobuf wire definitions compiled into the SDK (protobuf-javalite).
- Project: https://github.com/livekit/protocol (commit 8381f218): a git submodule in the development repository;
  the public source tree vendors `protocol/protobufs/` with the project's `LICENSE` and `NOTICE`, unmodified
  (`protocol/VENDORED.md`)
- Copyright LiveKit, Inc.
- License: Apache-2.0 — https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0
- Notes: the submodule's `.proto` files are unmodified. The copies protoc compiles are rewritten at
  build time (`gradle/gravix-proto-names.gradle`): file names `gravixcloud_*.proto`, `package
  gravixcloud;`, Java classes `gravixcloud.Gravixcloud*`, upstream name removed from comments. Messages, fields and enum values are
  unchanged and the binary encoding carries no package name, so the wire format is identical.

### audioswitch (vendored as `com.gravixcloud.rtc.audioswitch`)
Audio device enumeration and routing for Android.
- Project: https://github.com/twilio/audioswitch, via the fork https://github.com/davidliu/audioswitch
  at 039a35aefab7747c557242fa216c9ea11743b604 (version 1.2.0)
- Copyright 2020 Twilio, inc.
- License: Apache-2.0 — `third_party/audioswitch/LICENSE.txt`
- Notes: package relocated, provenance header added to each file; details in
  `third_party/audioswitch/README.md`.

